{"repositoryId":1255191157,"availability":"available","full":"JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction","name":"heart-disease-risk-prediction","description":"Production-ready heart-disease risk prediction — leakage-free XGBoost pipeline with per-patient SHAP explainability, served via FastAPI + Streamlit, Dockerised and tested with CI.","category":"Design","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-31T14:20:52Z","updated":"2026-06-06T15:11:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://heart-disease-risk-prediction.streamlit.app","topics":["docker","explainable-ai","fastapi","healthcare","machine-learning","mlops","portfolio","python","scikit-learn","shap","streamlit","xgboost"],"demo":"https://heart-disease-risk-prediction.streamlit.app**/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.776Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.776Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.776Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.776Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A leakage-free, end-to-end machine-learning system that predicts the presence of heart disease from 11 routine clinical measurements — served as both a FastAPI REST service and an interactive Streamlit app, with real per-patient SHAP explanations.","🔗 Live Demo: · 📖 API Docs: run uvicorn api.main:app → /docs","Cardiovascular disease is the leading cause of death worldwide. This project trains a calibrated classifier on the UCI / Cleveland heart-disease dataset and exposes it through clean, production-style interfaces. It is built to demonstrate the full ML lifecycle — data validation, leakage-free preprocessing, model comparison, hyperparameter tuning, explainability, testing, and deployment — not just a notebook that prints an accuracy score."],"features":["🔬 Leakage-free pipeline — imputation + scaling live inside an sklearn","Pipeline, so they are fit on training folds only. (The original notebook imputed the full dataset before splitting — a textbook leak.)","🤖 Model comparison + tuning — Logistic Regression, Random Forest, SVM and","XGBoost compared by stratified CV; the winner is tuned with RandomizedSearchCV and the tuned model is the one that ships.","🧠 Real SHAP explanations — genuine per-patient feature contributions"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"75cae6222c913c8b515962bd6a4ea0d179e5c3709a996e8e6638c261fdd4810c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.978Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.978Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A leakage-free, end-to-end machine-learning system that predicts the presence of heart disease from 11 routine clinical measurements — served as both a FastAPI REST service and an interactive Streamlit app, with real per-patient SHAP explanations.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Optional auth + history front-end (the original Flask app had login/SQLite;","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"75cae6222c913c8b515962bd6a4ea0d179e5c3709a996e8e6638c261fdd4810c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.978Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-06T15:11:01Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JAGHDHEEP/heart-disease-risk-prediction/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:47:00.979Z","hash":"75cae6222c913c8b515962bd6a4ea0d179e5c3709a996e8e6638c261fdd4810c","originalBytes":13778,"storedBytes":13778,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["streamlit","app","docs","model","python","api","dataset","disease","models","service","src","bash","heart","test","training","data","demo","fastapi","license